148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (This report presents an account of the four-week industrial internship undertaken at Central Coalfields Limited \(CCL\), a Miniratna subsidiary of Coal India Limited, at the System Department, Hazaribagh Area, Charhi, Jharkhand, from 3rd June 2026 to 3rd July 2026. The internship was carried out under the guidance of Mr. Suraj Kumar, SO \(System\) In-Charge, Hazaribagh Area, as part of the requirement for the degree of Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science and Engineering at IILM University, Greater Noida. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
