151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (Central Coalfields Limited \(CCL\) is one of the leading subsidiaries of Coal India Limited \(CIL\), a Maharatna public sector undertaking under the Ministry of Coal, Government of India. Headquartered in Ranchi, Jharkhand, CCL is primarily engaged in the exploration, extraction and production of coal across its various coalfields and areas in the state of Jharkhand, including the Hazaribagh Area, where this internship was undertaken. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (The System Department at CCL, Hazaribagh Area, is responsible for the upkeep of computer systems, software infrastructure, data handling and IT-enabled operations that support the organization's administrative and operational functions. The department plays a key role in ensuring smooth day-to-day IT operations, technical troubleshooting and systems support across the area office. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
