/E (The scope of the project is limited to building a prototype prediction system that takes available academic and related attributes as input and outputs a predicted performance category or score. The project focuses on the core data pipeline, model development and evaluation, and does not extend to full-scale deployment, integration with institutional databases, or handling of real-time streaming data, all of which are identified as areas for future enhancement. )
/Pg 17 0 R
